  <div class="article-body">
    {% include "signup.njk" %}
    <h2>What to expect</h2>
    <p>Each letter carries the new article, a short note on why it was written, and occasionally one thing worth reading elsewhere. No daily sends, no countdown timers, no "last chance" anything.</p>
    <h2>Consent, preferences, and leaving</h2>
    <p>Signing up sends you a confirmation email first. Nothing arrives until you click it. Every letter has an unsubscribe link at the bottom that works in one click, and a link to manage what you receive. You can also <a href="/newsletter/unsubscribe/">unsubscribe from here</a>.</p>
    <p>The list is hosted by Buttondown. Your address is used only to send this letter. It is never sold, shared, or used for advertising. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy details</a>.</p>
    <h2>Read past letters</h2>
    <p>Every issue is archived at <a href="{{ site.newsletter.archiveUrl }}">the letter archive</a>. You can also follow with <a href="/feed.xml">RSS</a>.</p>
  </div>
